summary:
  The output plays the listener's level alone.

history:
  The option would be ticked, every station read, and nothing would be heard
  of it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          audioOutput: AudioOutput { id: playMusicSink; volume: playMusicOutput.volume * loudness.gain }

replace:
          audioOutput: AudioOutput { id: playMusicSink; volume: playMusicOutput.volume }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_stations_factor_sits_in_one_place_and_in_no_number_a_listener_sees.
  Line-neutral.
